WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.594
Deep networks memorize training data,

00:00:02.674 --> 00:00:06.352
and memorization ties to generalization and privacy.

00:00:06.432 --> 00:00:10.110
Feldman's memorization score is rigorous but costly,

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:14.808
while input loss curvature is a cheap proxy nobody
could justify.

00:00:14.888 --> 00:00:20.228
This Purdue ICML 2024 paper builds the missing
theory linking memorization,

00:00:20.308 --> 00:00:24.420
curvature, and differential privacy on CIFAR and ImageNet.
